<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>SBJetsamGuard</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>SpringBoard 内存限额保护</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>这是进程限额缓解，不增加物理 RAM，也不保证避免所有重启。用户可选择 1024 / 2048 / 4096 MiB；已有更高限额保持原样；不吞信号、不杀 SpringBoard。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用限额保护</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.sbjetsamguard</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>readPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkListCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>限额预设</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>limitPreset</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>2048</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.sbjetsamguard</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>readPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>detail</key>
			<string>PSListItemsController</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<string>1024</string>
				<string>2048</string>
				<string>4096</string>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>1024 MiB</string>
				<string>2048 MiB（推荐）</string>
				<string>4096 MiB（高风险实验）</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>推荐值与适用范围</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>主流设备可按需要选择 1024 / 2048 / 4096 MiB。2048 MiB 为推荐起点，4096 MiB 可能挤压其他进程并增加全局内存压力；这是 SpringBoard 进程限额请求，不增加物理 RAM。用户可以直接选择，插件只显示风险提示。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>内存优化</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>普通优化只作用于 helper 当前进程，使用有界预算并在低可用内存、超时或压力条件下自动停止，结束后释放全部临时内存。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>内存优化</string>
			<key>action</key><string>requestNormalMemoryTrim</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>深度优化</string>
			<key>action</key><string>requestDeepMemoryTrim</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>磁盘缓存清理</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>手动按钮只向 helper 请求清理磁盘缓存，不清 RAM、不增加可用物理内存。包含应用缓存默认关闭；开启后应用可能重新下载或重建缓存。不会自动清理应用 Documents、数据库或用户资料。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清理时包含应用缓存（谨慎）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>cleanAppCaches</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.sbjetsamguard</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>readPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>请求手动清理缓存…</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>requestCacheCleanup</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>实验性 sysctl 总开关（默认关闭）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>必须同时开启总开关与对应子项才请求修改；默认全部关闭。系统不支持、只读或缺权限的项由 helper 跳过。关闭后 helper 仅在值仍等于本插件设置值时恢复记录的原值，避免覆盖其他工具。不同 iOS 内核参数名称和效果可能不同，不保证优化。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>允许实验性 sysctl 修改</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>experimentalSysctls</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.sbjetsamguard</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>readPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
